  "chain": "individual error during hard match/concurrent verification [cause TBD] -> NLOs open 2RSY instead of closing 2RSX -> 2RY de-energized -> loss of power to Bus 23 -> 21 CL Pump trips -> low CL header pressure -> 121 MDCLP auto starts (reportable ESW actuation)",
